g\",\n      \"type\": \"Activity\",\n      \"description\": \"Learning is the process of acquiring new knowledge, behaviors, skills, values, or preferences.\",\n      \"attributes\": {}\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Entertainment\",\n      \"type\": \"Activity\",\n      \"description\": \"Entertainment is a form of activity that holds the attention and interest of an audience, or gives pleasure and delight.\",\n      \"attributes\": {}\n    }\n  ],\n  \"relations\": [\n    [\n      \"Electricity\",\n      \"Powers\",\n      \"Modern Technology\",\n      \"Electricity powers modern technology, enabling advancements in various fields such as computing, telecommunications, and healthcare.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"Electricity\",\n      \"Facilitates\",\n      \"Global Trade and Communication\",\n      \"The availability of electricity has facilitated global trade and communication, making it easier to connect and conduct business across the world.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"Electricity\",\n      \"Revolutionizes\",\n      \"Communication\",\n      \"Electricity has revolutionized communication through the invention of the telegraph, telephone, and internet, allowing people to connect instantaneously across vast distances.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"Electricity\",\n      \"Revolutionizes\",\n      \"Transportation\",\n      \"The electrification of transportation, through the use of electric cars and trains, has led to a reduction in greenhouse gas emissions and a shift towards sustainable energy sources.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"Electricity\",\n      \"Revolutionizes\",\n      \"Industrialization\",\n      \"Electricity has played a crucial role in driving industrialization, increasing production efficiency and output in factories and manufacturing plants.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"Electricity\",\n      \"Improves\",\n      \"Public Health and Safety\",\n      \"Electricity has improved public health and safety through advancements in medical technology, electric lighting, and heating and cooling systems.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"Electricity\",\n      \"Enables\",\n      \"Nighttime Operations in Cities\",\n      \"Electric lighting made it possible for cities to operate at night, reducing crime rates and creating a safer environment for residents.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"Electricity\",\n      \"Powers\",\n      \"Medical Technology\",\n      \"Advancements in medical technology powered by electricity have led to breakthroughs in healthcare, saving countless lives and improving overall well-being.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"Electricity\",\n      \"Powers\",\n      \"Household Appliances\",\n      \"Electric appliances like washing machines, refrigerators, and stoves have freed up time and energy for people, leading to a higher standard of living.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"Electricity\",\n      \"Powers\",\n      \"Heating and Cooling Systems\",\n      \"Electric heating and cooling systems have made it easier to regulate indoor temperatures, reducing the risk of heatstroke or hypothermia.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"Electricity\",\n      \"Transforms\",\n      \"Daily Life\",\n      \"Before the widespread adoption of electricity, daily life was much more labor-intensive and less efficient. Electricity has transformed daily life, making tasks easier and more efficient.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"Electricity\",\n      \"Drives\",\n      \"Economic Growth\",\n      \"Electricity has played a crucial role in driving economic growth by increasing production efficiency and enabling the development of new industries.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"society\",\n      \"Transformed By\",\n      \"electricity\",\n      \"Society has been profoundly transformed by the introduction and widespread use of electricity.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"society\",\n      \"Benefits From\",\n      \"telecommunications\",\n      \"Society benefits from the advancements in telecommunications, which have been significantly influenced by the development of elec