ricity\",\n      \"Enables\",\n      \"Computing\",\n      \"The development of electrical engineering has paved the way for innovations in computing, leading to more powerful and efficient computing systems.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"electricity\",\n      \"Facilitates\",\n      \"Public Health and Safety\",\n      \"The availability of electricity has improved public health and safety by providing reliable lighting, heating, and power for medical and safety equipment.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"electricity\",\n      \"Revolutionizes\",\n      \"World\",\n      \"Electricity has revolutionized the world in numerous ways, transforming industries, enhancing quality of life, and driving technological advancements.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"Stoves\",\n      \"Replaces\",\n      \"Manual Cooking Methods\",\n      \"Electric stoves have replaced manual cooking methods, reducing the physical effort required for cooking.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"Stoves\",\n      \"Contributes To\",\n      \"Higher Standard of Living\",\n      \"Electric stoves, along with other electric appliances, have contributed to a higher standard of living by freeing up time and energy for people to focus on other activities.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"Stoves\",\n      \"Part Of\",\n      \"Electric Appliances\",\n      \"Stoves are part of the category of electric appliances that have transformed daily household activities.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"healthcare\",\n      \"Enhanced By\",\n      \"medical technology\",\n      \"Advancements in medical technology, powered by electricity, have significantly enhanced healthcare capabilities.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"healthcare\",\n      \"Improved By\",\n      \"public health and safety\",\n      \"The availability of electricity has improved public health and safety, which in turn supports better healthcare outcomes.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"Telegraph\",\n      \"Part Of\",\n      \"Electricity Revolution\",\n      \"The telegraph is part of the electricity revolution, which transformed communication.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"Telegraph\",\n      \"Preceded By\",\n      \"Telephone\",\n      \"The telegraph preceded the invention of the telephone in the timeline of communication technologies.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"Telegraph\",\n      \"Preceded By\",\n      \"Internet\",\n      \"The telegraph preceded the development of the internet in the evolution of communication technologies.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"Telegraph\",\n      \"Contributed To\",\n      \"Communication Revolution\",\n      \"The telegraph contributed to the communication revolution by allowing people to connect instantaneously across vast distances.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"computers\",\n      \"Transformed\",\n      \"Work\",\n      \"Computers have transformed the way people work, making tasks more efficient and accessible.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"computers\",\n      \"Transformed\",\n      \"Learning\",\n      \"Computers have transformed the way people learn, providing access to vast amounts of information and interactive educational tools.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"computers\",\n      \"Transformed\",\n      \"Entertainment\",\n      \"Computers have transformed the way people entertain themselves, offering a wide range of digital media and interactive experiences.\"\n    ]\n  ]\n}"